### Transaction Ingest API — runnable examples
#
# Works with the VS Code REST Client extension and the JetBrains HTTP Client.
# Start the service first: `make demo` or `make run`.
#
# Run them top to bottom: several depend on the one before.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@ref = LC07-20260814-000918

### 1. A new transaction → 201, duplicate=false
POST {{host}}/ingest/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "lane-controller-07",
  "source_reference": "{{ref}}",
  "transaction_type": "toll",
  "transaction_time_utc": "2026-08-14T13:45:02Z",
  "base_amount": "12.50",
  "plate": { "number": "ABC1234", "jurisdiction": "TX" },
  "location": { "facility": "SH-130", "plaza": "12", "lane": "3", "direction": "NB" }
}

### 2. The identical push again → 200, duplicate=true, same id
# A producer retrying over an unreliable link. No second billable record.
POST {{host}}/ingest/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "lane-controller-07",
  "source_reference": "{{ref}}",
  "transaction_type": "toll",
  "transaction_time_utc": "2026-08-14T13:45:02Z",
  "base_amount": "12.50",
  "plate": { "number": "ABC1234", "jurisdiction": "TX" },
  "location": { "facility": "SH-130", "plaza": "12", "lane": "3", "direction": "NB" }
}

### 3. Same key, different amount → 200 on contract, divergence logged
# The gap the contract leaves open. See docs/adr/0006-idempotency-divergence.md.
POST {{host}}/ingest/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "lane-controller-07",
  "source_reference": "{{ref}}",
  "transaction_type": "toll",
  "transaction_time_utc": "2026-08-14T13:45:02Z",
  "base_amount": "99.00",
  "plate": { "number": "ABC1234", "jurisdiction": "TX" }
}

### 4. Transponder instead of a plate → 201
POST {{host}}/ingest/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "lane-controller-07",
  "source_reference": "LC07-TRANSPONDER-1",
  "transaction_type": "toll",
  "transaction_time_utc": "2026-08-14T13:45:02Z",
  "base_amount": "12.50",
  "transponder_number": "01800-1234 5678"
}

### 5. An image-review replay from three months ago → 201
# Old timestamps are legitimate. There is no posting window.
POST {{host}}/ingest/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "image-review-vendor",
  "source_reference": "IRV-2026-05-14-88213",
  "transaction_type": "violation",
  "transaction_time_utc": "2026-05-14T08:12:44Z",
  "base_amount": "12.50",
  "plate": { "number": "K-9924", "jurisdiction": "mex-tam" },
  "metadata": { "review_confidence": 0.87, "reviewed_by": "queue-3" }
}

### 6. A different currency → 201
POST {{host}}/ingest/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "interop-peer-gothenburg",
  "source_reference": "GBG-2026-08-14-771",
  "transaction_type": "toll",
  "transaction_time_utc": "2026-08-14T07:02:11Z",
  "base_amount": "22.00",
  "currency": "SEK",
  "plate": { "number": "ABC 12D", "jurisdiction": "SE" }
}

### 7. Empty body → 400, every missing field named
POST {{host}}/ingest/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 8. No usable identifier → 400
# Contract-valid and unbillable: the rule no JSON Schema can express.
POST {{host}}/ingest/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "lane-controller-07",
  "source_reference": "LC07-NO-IDENTIFIER",
  "transaction_type": "toll",
  "transaction_time_utc": "2026-08-14T13:45:02Z",
  "base_amount": "12.50"
}

### 9. Several semantic failures at once → 400, all reported together
POST {{host}}/ingest/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "lane-controller-07",
  "source_reference": "LC07-MULTIPLE-PROBLEMS",
  "transaction_type": "parking",
  "transaction_time_utc": "2027-08-14T13:45:02Z",
  "base_amount": "-1.005",
  "currency": "XYZ"
}

### 10. Too much precision for the currency → 400
POST {{host}}/ingest/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "lane-controller-07",
  "source_reference": "LC07-PRECISION",
  "transaction_type": "toll",
  "transaction_time_utc": "2026-08-14T13:45:02Z",
  "base_amount": "12.505",
  "plate": { "number": "ABC1234", "jurisdiction": "TX" }
}

### 11. Yen has no minor unit → 400
POST {{host}}/ingest/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "lane-controller-07",
  "source_reference": "LC07-JPY",
  "transaction_type": "toll",
  "transaction_time_utc": "2026-08-14T13:45:02Z",
  "base_amount": "350.5",
  "currency": "JPY",
  "plate": { "number": "ABC1234", "jurisdiction": "TX" }
}

### 12. Malformed JSON → 400
POST {{host}}/ingest/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{not json

### Liveness
GET {{host}}/healthz

### Readiness — names every dependency and its latency
GET {{host}}/readyz

### Metrics
GET {{host}}/metrics

### Outbox depth and lag, from the relay
GET http://localhost:9090/metrics
